on.com/\",\"children\":\"Neon\"}]\n63:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://orm.drizzle.team/\",\"children\":\"Drizzle ORM\"}],\" connects generated applications to their Neon database\"]}]\n64:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://hono.dev/\",\"children\":\"Hono\"}],\" is the web framework\"]}]\n65:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://deno.com/\",\"children\":\"Deno\"}],\" is also used in parts of the runtime environment\"]}]\n66:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.twilio.com/en-us\",\"children\":\"Twilio\"}],\" powers the WhatsApp-based interface\"]}]\n67:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"And all the other cloud infra components run in AWS\"}]\n68:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"giving-every-app-its-own-isolated-postgres-database-aka-its-own-neon-project\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Giving every app its own isolated Postgres database (aka, its own Neon project)\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#giving-every-app-its-own-isolated-postgres-database-aka-its-own-neon-project\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Giving every app its own isolated Postgres database (aka, its own Neon project)\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$57:12:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n69:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Every generated app by QwikBuild is a real web application that needs persistent storage, independent scaling, isolation from other apps, and low idle cost to make the growth rate sustainable.\"}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"The QwikBuild team knew that building on top of shared databases would introduce operational complexity as the number of generated apps increased, so they chose a simpler model: \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"every generated app gets its own isolated Postgres instance\"}],\".\"]}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"In Neon, this means\"}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"one Neon project per app,\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"provisioned programmatically,\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"available instantly,\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"and fully isolated by default\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"If you’re not familiar with \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/\",\"children\":\"Neon\"}],\", this design might sound expensive and operationally heavy. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":[\"In any other managed Postgres, deploying independent instances per app can quickly become difficult to manage – but Neon’s \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/docs/introduction/architecture-overview\",\"children\":\"unique architecture\"}],\" makes this pattern practical\"]}],\".\"]}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Because compute and storage are decoupled in Neon, each Postgres project scales independently, with each compute \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/docs/introduction/architecture-overview\",\"children\":\"scaling down to zero\"}],\" when not in use. Implementation is also simple – Neon’s \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/docs/guides/javascript\",\"children\":\"JavaScript packages\"}],\" integrated cleanly with QwikBuild’s serverless environments, coding sandboxes, and function-as-a-service cloud infrastructure.\"]}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"scaling-the-fleet-without-fearing-high-costs\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",nu"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ll,{\"children\":[\"Scaling the fleet without fearing high costs\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#scaling-the-fleet-without-fearing-high-costs\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Scaling the fleet without fearing high costs\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$57:12:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"blockquote\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"“Soon, AI agents will do most of the coding, and perhaps 1000x more database instances will be needed. Neon’s platform and pricing strategy feel aligned with that future”\"}],[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}],\"(\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/nileshtrivedi/\",\"children\":\"Nilesh Trivedi\"}],\", co-founder and CTO at QwikBuild) \"]}]}]\n71:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"When you’re generating apps programmatically,\"}]\n72:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"some apps may receive steady traffic,\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"others may grow quickly and unexpectedly,\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"and many may sit idle for long periods\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This variability makes infrastructure planning difficult if compute and storage are tightly coupled. But when deploying a project-per-app model in Neon,\"}]\n74:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Every app (tenant) has storage and compute resources that behave independently of all the other tenants\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/storage\",\"children\":\"Storage scales automatically,\"}],\" without needing to be pre-provisioned in advance, and persists independently of compute\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/docs/introduction/autoscaling\",\"children\":\"Compute capacity autoscales\"}],\" when traffic increases (e.g. for apps seeing traffic spikes)\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"And when an app goes idle, \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.com/docs/introduction/scale-to-zero\",\"children\":\"compute scales down all the way to zero\"}],\" (e.g. for the majority of the fleet that may stay idle most of the time)\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"This flexibility allows platforms like QwikBuild to support both small business websites and more complex web applications without changing the underlying model. \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"It keeps infrastructure costs aligned with real activity, not with pre-provisioned capacity.\"}]]}]\n76:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"safe-iteration-with-branching-and-point-in-time-restore\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Safe iteration with branching and point-in-time restore\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":